      "reviewSummary": {
        "text": {
          "text": "Diners like this restaurant's delicious and hearty rice bowls, including gyudon, katsudon, and toridon, which are served quickly. They also highlight the affordable prices and generous portions, making it a great value. Guests mention the friendly and energetic staff, contributing to a welcoming and lively atmosphere.",
